WEBVTT

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.840
but also that joy in itself is not enough.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:36.416
If you want to achieve fluency
in a foreign language,

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.920
you'll also need to apply
three more principles.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:42.360
First of all, you'll need
effective methods.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:46.576
If you try to memorize a list of words
for a test tomorrow,

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.976
the words will be stored
in your short-term memory

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.905
and you'll forget them after a few days.

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:54.336
If you, however,
want to keep words long term,

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:57.296
you need to revise them
in the course of a few days repeatedly

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.536
using the so-called space repetition.

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:03.816
You can use apps which are based
on this system such as Anki or Memrise,